<title>SOUTH AFRICA: JSE admits Syfrets Securities as corporate entity.</title>
<headline>JSE admits Syfrets Securities as corporate entity.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syfrets Securities Ltd has been admitted as a corporate entity (limited liability) member of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange with effect from September 30, the JSE said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
